  "description": "Description of the Proposal\n\nNon-material amendments to the approved development comprising minor alterations to the front (south) elevation, including revised entrance and fire exit door openings, a minor adjustment to the existing service yard entrance, and the formation of a new service yard entrance.\n\nThe proposal also include minor internal alterations within the existing building envelope, including the formation of a small first-floor mezzanine for ancillary staff welfare facilities and the reconfiguration and reduction of ground floor office accommodation to provide additional warehouse-linked space. The amendments result in a net reduction in overall floorspace, with no change to the approved use and no increase in the external building envelope.",
